rews</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Kamath</surname><given-names>PS.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Management of EcV</article-title><source>Hepatology</source><year>1998</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>1154</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/hep.510280434</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Norton ID, Andrews JC, Kamath PS. Management of EcV. Hepatology. 1998;28:1154&#x02013;8. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9755256</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR5"><label>5.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Matsui</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kojima</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kakizaki</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Nagasaka</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Sohara</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Sato</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Ectopic varices in a right diaphragm that ruptured into the pleural cavity</article-title><source>Acta Med Okayama</source><year>2006</year><volume>60</volume><fpage>229</fpage><lpage>32</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Matsui M, Kojima A, Kakizaki S, Nagasaka K, Sohara N, Sato K, et&#x000a0;al. Ectopic varices in a right diaphragm that ruptured into the pleural cavity. Acta Med Okayama. 2006;60:229&#x02013;32. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16943860</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR6"><label>6.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mitchell</surname><given-names>AW</given-names></name><name><surname>Jackson</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Trans-anastomotic porto-portal varices in patients with gastrointestinal haemorrhage</article-title><source>Clin Radiol</source><year>20