. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">314792</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR14"><label>14.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Itzchak</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Glickman</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Splenic vein thrombosis in patients with a normal size spleen</article-title><source>Invest Radiol</source><year>1977</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>158</fpage><lpage>63</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00004424-197703000-00010</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Itzchak Y, Glickman MG. Splenic vein thrombosis in patients with a normal size spleen. Invest Radiol. 1977;12:158&#x02013;63. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">576863</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR15"><label>15.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sorrentino</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Labombarda</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Debiase</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Trevisi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Giagu</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cavernous transformation of the portal vein associated to multiorgan developmental abnormalities</article-title><source>Liver Int</source><year>2004</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>80</fpage><lpage>3</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1478-3231.2004.00890.x</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Sorrentino D, Labombarda A, Debiase F, Trevisi A, Giagu P. Cavernous transformation of the portal vein associated to multiorgan developmental abnormalities. Liver Int. 2004;24:80&#x02013;3. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15102004</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR16"><label>16.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><su